(1, 2, "Davlat farmakopeyasidagi ro‘yxatlarning to‘g‘ri ta’riflarini belgilang.",
 ["A ro‘yxati — zaharli dorilar (Venena)", "B ro‘yxati — kuchli ta’sir etuvchi dorilar (Heroica)", "A ro‘yxati — kuchli ta’sir etuvchi dorilar (Heroica)", "B ro‘yxati — retseptsiz beriladigan dorilar"],
 "Mark the correct definitions of the lists in the State Pharmacopoeia.",
 ["List A — poisonous drugs (Venena)", "List B — potent drugs (Heroica)", "List A — potent drugs (Heroica)", "List B — drugs dispensed without a prescription"],
 "A ro‘yxati dorilari alohida qulflanadigan shkafda saqlanadi; B — tibbiy nazoratsiz qo‘llanganda asorat berishi mumkin.",
 "List A drugs are kept in a separate locked cabinet; List B drugs can cause harm if used without medical control."),
(1, 2, "Ta’sir birligida (TB) dozalanadigan dorilarni belgilang.",
 ["Insulin", "Geparin", "Paratsetamol", "Amoksitsillin"],
 "Mark the drugs dosed in units (U).",
 ["Insulin", "Heparin", "Paracetamol", "Amoxicillin"],
 "TB da insulin, geparin, benzilpenitsillin, nistatin, ayrim gormon va fermentlar dozalanadi.",
 "Insulin, heparin, benzylpenicillin, nystatin and some hormones and enzymes are dosed in units."),
(1, 2, "Yumshoq dori shakllarini belgilang.",
 ["Surtma", "Shamcha", "Draje", "Granula"],
 "Mark the soft dosage forms.",
 ["Ointment", "Suppository", "Dragée", "Granules"],
 "Yumshoq shakllar: surtma, pasta, krem, gel, liniment, shamcha, plastir. Draje va granula — qattiq shakllar.",
 "Soft forms are ointments, pastes, creams, gels, liniments, suppositories and plasters. Dragées and granules are solid forms."),
(2, 2, "Krem va gellar haqidagi to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["Ikkalasi ham ofitsinal bo‘lib, qisqartirilgan shaklda yoziladi", "Gel teriga tez so‘riladi va sovutuvchi ta’sir beradi", "Krem tarkibida suv bo‘lmaydi", "Gel faqat lanolin asosida tayyorlanadi"],
 "Mark the correct statements about creams and gels.",
 ["Both are officinal and are written in the short form", "A gel is quickly absorbed by the skin and has a cooling effect", "A cream contains no water", "A gel is made only on a lanolin base"],
 "Krem — suv saqlovchi emulsion asosli shakl; gel — jelatin, agar-agar, karbomer kabi gel hosil qiluvchilar asosida.",
 "A cream has a water-containing emulsion base; a gel is based on gelling agents such as gelatin, agar or carbomer."),
(2, 2, "Rektal shamchalar haqidagi to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["To‘g‘ri ichakning pastki qismidan so‘rilgan dori jigarni qisman chetlab o‘tadi", "Qusayotgan bemorlarda va kichik yoshdagi bolalarda qulay", "Faqat mahalliy ta’sir uchun ishlatiladi", "Xona haroratida suyuq holda bo‘ladi"],
 "Mark the correct statements about rectal suppositories.",
 ["A drug absorbed from the lower rectum partly bypasses the liver", "They are convenient for vomiting patients and young children", "They are used only for a local effect", "They are liquid at room temperature"],
 "Dori pastki va o‘rta to‘g‘ri ichak venalari orqali pastki kovak venaga tushadi; shamchalar mahalliy va rezorbtiv ta’sir uchun ishlatiladi.",
 "The drug passes through the lower and middle rectal veins into the inferior vena cava; suppositories are used for local and systemic effects."),
(2, 2, "Dori dozasi yuqori dozadan oshib ketsa, shifokor retseptda nima qiladi?",
 ["Miqdorni so‘z bilan yozadi", "Undov belgisi qo‘yib, imzosi bilan tasdiqlaydi", "Dozani ikkiga bo‘lib, ikki retseptda yozadi", "Blankaning yuqorisiga Cito! deb yozadi"],
 "What does the doctor do in the prescription if the dose is above the maximum dose?",
 ["Writes the amount in words", "Adds an exclamation mark and confirms it with a signature", "Splits the dose into two prescriptions", "Writes Cito! at the top of the form"],
 "Tasdiq belgisining yo‘qligi ko‘p uchraydigan retsept xatolaridan biri.",
 "A missing confirmation is one of the common prescription errors."),
(2, 2, "Lanolinga xos xususiyatlarni belgilang.",
 ["Qo‘y junidan olinadi", "Teridan yaxshi so‘riladi va ko‘p suv shimadi (150% gacha)", "Teridan so‘rilmaydi, faqat yuza ta’sir uchun ishlatiladi", "Tez achiydi, shuning uchun hozir kam ishlatiladi"],
 "Mark the properties of lanolin.",
 ["It is obtained from sheep’s wool", "It is well absorbed by the skin and takes up much water (up to 150%)", "It is not absorbed by the skin and is used only for a surface effect", "It turns rancid quickly, so it is rarely used today"],
 "Teridan so‘rilmaslik — vazelinga, tez achish — cho‘chqa yog‘iga xos.",
 "Not being absorbed is typical of petrolatum, and turning rancid quickly is typical of lard."),
(2, 2, "Retard va ichakda eriydigan (enterik) qobiqli tabletkalar haqida to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["Ularni bo‘lish, chaynash va maydalash mumkin emas", "Signaturada “chaynamasdan yutilsin” deb eslatiladi", "Tez ta’sir uchun til ostiga qo‘yiladi", "Ezib, suvda eritib ichish tavsiya etiladi"],
 "Mark the correct statements about retard and enteric-coated tablets.",
 ["They must not be split, chewed or crushed", "The signature reminds the patient to “swallow without chewing”", "They are placed under the tongue for a quick effect", "They should be crushed and dissolved in water"],
 "Qobiq buzilsa, butun doza birdaniga so‘riladi (nifedipin, morfin retard) yoki modda me’da kislotasida parchalanadi (omeprazol, pankreatin).",
 "If the coating is broken, the whole dose is absorbed at once (nifedipine or morphine retard) or the drug is destroyed by stomach acid (omeprazole, pancreatin)."),
(3, 2, "Kukun shaklida yozish mumkin bo‘lmagan moddalarni belgilang.",
 ["Kalsiy xlorid", "Kamfora bilan mentol aralashmasi", "Magniy oksidi", "Natriy gidrokarbonat"],
 "Mark the substances that cannot be prescribed as a powder.",
 ["Calcium chloride", "A mixture of camphor and menthol", "Magnesium oxide", "Sodium bicarbonate"],
 "Kalsiy xlorid kuchli gigroskopik, kamfora bilan mentol aralashganda suyulib qoladi (evtektik). Magniy oksidi va natriy gidrokarbonat kukunda yoziladi.",
 "Calcium chloride is strongly hygroscopic, and camphor with menthol liquefies (eutectic mixture). Magnesium oxide and sodium bicarbonate are prescribed as powders."),
(3, 2, "Retseptda qisqartirib yozish mumkin bo‘lgan so‘zlarni belgilang.",
 ["Unguentum (ung.)", "Aqua (aq.)", "Analginum (dori moddasi nomi)", "Natrium (kimyoviy element nomi)"],
 "Mark the words that may be abbreviated in a prescription.",
 ["Unguentum (ung.)", "Aqua (aq.)", "Analginum (a drug name)", "Natrium (a chemical element)"],
 "Dori, o‘simlik va kimyoviy element nomlari qisqartirilmaydi; istisno: aq., sp., ac.",
 "Names of drugs, plants and chemical elements are not abbreviated; the exceptions are aq., sp. and ac."),
