(1, 3, "Qattiq dori shakllarini belgilang.",
 ["Tabletka", "Kapsula", "Draje", "Liniment", "Pasta", "Shamcha"],
 "Mark the solid dosage forms.",
 ["Tablet", "Capsule", "Dragée", "Liniment", "Paste", "Suppository"],
 "Liniment, pasta va shamcha — yumshoq dori shakllari.",
 "Liniments, pastes and suppositories are soft dosage forms."),
(1, 3, "Uy sharoitidagi dozalash birliklarining to‘g‘ri hajmlarini belgilang.",
 ["1 choy qoshiq — 5 ml", "1 desert qoshiq — 10 ml", "1 osh qoshiq — 15 ml", "1 choy qoshiq — 10 ml", "1 osh qoshiq — 30 ml", "1 desert qoshiq — 20 ml"],
 "Mark the correct volumes of household measures.",
 ["1 teaspoon — 5 ml", "1 dessert spoon — 10 ml", "1 tablespoon — 15 ml", "1 teaspoon — 10 ml", "1 tablespoon — 30 ml", "1 dessert spoon — 20 ml"],
 "Choy qoshiq 5 ml, desert qoshiq 10 ml, osh qoshiq 15 ml.",
 "A teaspoon is 5 ml, a dessert spoon 10 ml and a tablespoon 15 ml."),
(2, 3, "Retseptning qaysi qismlari lotin tilida yoziladi?",
 ["Invocatio (Rp.:)", "Designatio materiarum (dori nomlari va miqdori)", "Subscriptio (farmatsevtga ko‘rsatma)", "Signatura (qo‘llash usuli)", "Nomen aegroti (bemorning ismi)", "Datum (sana)"],
 "Which parts of a prescription are written in Latin?",
 ["Invocatio (Rp.:)", "Designatio materiarum (drug names and amounts)", "Subscriptio (instructions to the pharmacist)", "Signatura (directions for use)", "Nomen aegroti (patient’s name)", "Datum (date)"],
 "Lotin tilida faqat 5, 6 va 7-qismlar yoziladi; signatura va boshqa qismlar davlat tilida.",
 "Only parts 5, 6 and 7 are in Latin; the signature and the other parts are in the state language."),
(2, 3, "Surtmaga retsept qaysi hollarda kengaytirilgan shaklda yoziladi?",
 ["Surtma magistral bo‘lsa", "Asos vazelin bo‘lmasa", "Ikki va undan ortiq faol modda bo‘lsa", "Surtma ofitsinal va bitta faol moddali bo‘lsa", "Ko‘z surtmasi bo‘lgani uchun", "Faol modda 25% gacha bo‘lsa"],
 "In which cases is an ointment prescribed in the extended form?",
 ["When the ointment is magistral", "When the base is not petrolatum", "When there are two or more active substances", "When the ointment is officinal with one active substance", "Because it is an eye ointment", "When the active substance is up to 25%"],
 "Kengaytirilgan shaklda har modda alohida qatorda, asos “ad” bilan, so‘ng M.f. unguentum yoziladi. Ofitsinal ko‘z surtmasi qisqartirilgan shaklda yoziladi.",
 "In the extended form each substance is on its own line, the base is brought up with “ad”, then M.f. unguentum. An officinal eye ointment is written in the short form."),
(2, 3, "Transdermal terapevtik tizimlar (TTT) haqidagi to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["Dorini qonga doimiy, nazorat qilinadigan tezlikda chiqaradi", "Jigarni chetlab o‘tadi", "Misollar: nitrogliserin, fentanil, nikotin plastirlari", "Fentanilli plastirni kesib, dozani kamaytirish mumkin", "Isitilganda so‘rilish kamayadi", "Faqat bog‘lamni mahkamlash uchun ishlatiladi"],
 "Mark the correct statements about transdermal therapeutic systems (TTS).",
 ["They release the drug into the blood at a steady, controlled rate", "They bypass the liver", "Examples are nitroglycerin, fentanyl and nicotine patches", "A fentanyl patch may be cut to lower the dose", "Heating reduces absorption", "They are used only to hold a dressing in place"],
 "Fentanilli plastirni kesish va isitish taqiqlanadi: isitilganda so‘rilish keskin oshib, nafas markazi tormozlanishi mumkin.",
 "A fentanyl patch must not be cut or heated: heat sharply increases absorption and may depress the respiratory centre."),
(3, 3, "Qaysi yozuvlar retsept xatosi hisoblanadi?",
 ["Rp.: Analginum 0,5", "Doza “,5” tarzida yozilgan", "Signaturada “ichki” deb yozilgan", "Rp.: Analgini 0,5", "D.t.d. N. 20 in tabulettis", "Signatura davlat tilida aniq yozilgan"],
 "Which entries are prescription errors?",
 ["Rp.: Analginum 0,5", "The dose is written as “,5”", "The signature just says “internally”", "Rp.: Analgini 0,5", "D.t.d. N. 20 in tabulettis", "The signature is written clearly in the state language"],
 "Modda nomi qaratqichda (Analgini) bo‘lishi, verguldan oldin raqam turishi va signatura aniq bo‘lishi shart.",
 "The drug name must be in the genitive (Analgini), there must be a digit before the comma, and the signature must be specific."),
(3, 3, "Kapsulalar haqidagi to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["Dori ta’mi va hidini yashiradi", "Me’da shilliq qavatini dorining qitiqlovchi ta’siridan himoya qiladi", "Yumshoq (elastik) jelatin kapsulalar moyli eritmalar uchun ishlatiladi", "Kraxmal kapsulalar hozir eng ko‘p ishlatiladi", "Enterosolyubil kapsulalar me’dada eriydi", "Kapsulaga faqat kukun joylanadi"],
 "Mark the correct statements about capsules.",
 ["They mask the taste and smell of a drug", "They protect the stomach lining from the drug’s irritating effect", "Soft (elastic) gelatin capsules are used for oily solutions", "Starch capsules are the most widely used today", "Enteric capsules dissolve in the stomach", "Only powders are put into capsules"],
 "Kraxmal kapsulalar deyarli ishlatilmaydi, enterosolyubil kapsulalar faqat ichakda eriydi; kapsulaga kukun, granula, pasta yoki suyuqlik joylanadi.",
 "Starch capsules are hardly used, enteric capsules dissolve only in the intestine, and capsules can hold powders, granules, pastes or liquids."),
