(2, 5, "Quyidagilardan yumshoq dori shakllariga kiradiganlarini belgilang.",
 ["Surtma", "Pasta", "Krem", "Liniment", "Shamcha", "Tabletka", "Draje", "Kapsula", "Granula", "Kukun"],
 "From the list below, mark the forms that are soft dosage forms.",
 ["Ointment", "Paste", "Cream", "Liniment", "Suppository", "Tablet", "Dragée", "Capsule", "Granules", "Powder"],
 "Gel va plastir ham yumshoq shakllarga kiradi; tabletka, draje, kapsula, granula va kukun — qattiq shakllar.",
 "Gels and plasters are soft forms too; tablets, dragées, capsules, granules and powders are solid forms."),
(3, 5, "Retsept tarkibiy qismlarining to‘g‘ri ta’riflarini belgilang.",
 ["Inscriptio — davolash muassasasining shtampi va kodi", "Datum — retsept yozilgan sana", "Nomen aegroti — bemorning F.I.O. va yoshi", "Invocatio — Rp.: (Recipe — ol)", "Signatura — bemorga dorini qo‘llash usuli", "Nomen medici — bemorning F.I.O.", "Subscriptio — shifokorning imzosi va muhri", "Designatio materiarum — dorini qo‘llash usuli", "Signum et sigillum medici — farmatsevtga ko‘rsatma", "Datum — dori miqdori"],
 "Mark the correct definitions of the parts of a prescription.",
 ["Inscriptio — stamp and code of the health facility", "Datum — date the prescription was written", "Nomen aegroti — patient’s full name and age", "Invocatio — Rp.: (Recipe — take)", "Signatura — directions for the patient", "Nomen medici — patient’s full name", "Subscriptio — doctor’s signature and seal", "Designatio materiarum — directions for use", "Signum et sigillum medici — instructions to the pharmacist", "Datum — amount of the drug"],
 "Nomen medici — shifokor ismi; Subscriptio — farmatsevtga ko‘rsatma; Designatio materiarum — dori nomlari va miqdori; Signum et sigillum medici — imzo va muhr.",
 "Nomen medici is the doctor’s name; Subscriptio is the instruction to the pharmacist; Designatio materiarum lists the drugs and amounts; Signum et sigillum medici is the signature and seal."),
(3, 5, "Qattiq dori shakllarining kamchiliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Ta’sir nisbatan sekin boshlanadi", "Hushsiz va qusayotgan bemorlarga yaroqsiz", "Me’da-ichak shilliq qavatini qitiqlashi mumkin", "So‘rilish ovqat, me’da pH i va ichak harakatiga bog‘liq", "Ba’zi dorilar jigarda birinchi o‘tishda parchalanadi", "Dozalash aniq", "Saqlash va tashish qulay", "Fizik-kimyoviy jihatdan barqaror, uzoq saqlanadi", "Mikrob bilan ifloslanishga chidamli", "Noxush ta’m va hidni qobiq bilan yashirish mumkin"],
 "Mark the disadvantages of solid dosage forms.",
 ["The effect starts relatively slowly", "They are unsuitable for unconscious and vomiting patients", "They may irritate the gastrointestinal lining", "Absorption depends on food, gastric pH and gut motility", "Some drugs are broken down in the liver on first pass", "Dosing is accurate", "They are easy to store and carry", "They are physically and chemically stable and keep for a long time", "They resist microbial contamination", "An unpleasant taste and smell can be masked by a coating"],
 "Oxirgi beshtasi qattiq dori shakllarining afzalliklari.",
 "The last five are advantages of solid dosage forms."),
